                "answers"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves the facts you may see (tenant, role, privacy ceiling, `valid_at`, `known_at`),\nasks the configured LLM to answer from them only, and verifies every citation against\nthe facts it was given. `status` is `answered`, `insufficient_evidence` (no model call\nwhen nothing is retrievable) or `ungrounded` (the answer is withheld). A model failure\nis a 503, never an invented answer.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"What was customer-991's credit limit at 11:00 on 15 January?\"\n}",
